FADE IN:

INT. MOUNTAIN OPERATIONS ROOM - DAWN

[[AMBIENCE: radio hiss, distant engines, wind against canvas]]
[[MUSIC: restrained military tension]]

A map of the operational area is spread across a table. CAPTAIN ELIAN and MIRA stand over it.

LENKA
(serious)
The analysts inside the orchard decoded a repeating command phrase. They believe it links the forged orders to a single source.

[[SHOT: map]]
[[MAP: operational area, player start, objective route, enemy approach]]

COMMANDER SAVA
(measured)
The complex is full of blind corners and old irrigation channels. A direct assault could bury the evidence.

LENKA
(firm)
Reach the analysts, escort them out, and preserve the transmission equipment.

